{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/extras/9a6bb988f68073942f13f89250ce1bd0.avif?t=1761202939\" width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/extras/2a7139eb676b022b44c64ff9d36485a0.poster.avif?t=1761202939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/extras/2a7139eb676b022b44c64ff9d36485a0.webm?t=1761202939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sons of Odin</strong> is an online card battler inspired by an 18th-century Eastern European card game, set in a world of Norse fantasy. Pick your hero, command the runes, experiment, and triumph in this fast-paced yet deeply tactical card duel where every move can change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/extras/167b4dc28b3468907005d405c0cb7303.avif?t=1761202939\" width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/extras/f387ee333bdbcd552a32c9df2f60b099.poster.avif?t=1761202939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/extras/f387ee333bdbcd552a32c9df2f60b099.webm?t=1761202939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not just \u201cDurak\u201d!</strong> The classic mechanics of an 18th-century Eastern European card game are reimagined as a tactical card battler: now with passive skills, ultimate abilities, location eff ects, and rune influence. Each match is fast yet strategic \u2014 it\u2019s not enough to know the rules, you must react, manage your resources, and adapt. Play a familiar game in a completely new way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/extras/3efda9f9289397cc0b35b1ac5a9ea90b.avif?t=1761202939\" width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/extras/9557ffc1bf611a380f9d76a34b8a4564.poster.avif?t=1761202939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/extras/9557ffc1bf611a380f9d76a34b8a4564.webm?t=1761202939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight for \u2014 and against!</strong> Embark on a campaign inspired by Norse sagas, but with a playful twist on mythic archetypes as you journey across the Nine Worlds! And when you\u2019re done liberating Asgard \u2014 conquer it instead in PvP battles of every kind: from tense duels to chaotic four-player clashes! Let the cards fly instead of axes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/extras/bb224fb897eb6b3ed00064ffeb69a197.avif?t=1761202939\" width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/extras/ea84d55c7977378eb67da72d1da0eff4.poster.avif?t=1761202939\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/extras/ea84d55c7977378eb67da72d1da0eff4.webm?t=1761202939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The new fashion of the Nine Worlds!</strong> Collect stylish, one-of-a-kind decks and enjoy the rich visual style of reimagined Norse folklore. You\u2019ve never seen Asgard like this before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/extras/67d7b09856a28cea8b9cebecf9b0f01f.avif?t=1761202939\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3642720?t=1761202939","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/3a1a055df570cdc66ef5c73e10dd05139916cc5a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761202939","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/5fd51dfb81a899e03560870f60bd036535629061/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761202939","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/5fd51dfb81a899e03560870f60bd036535629061/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761202939","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3755230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642720/extras/9a6bb988f68073942f13f89250ce1bd0.avif?t=176